# Files the template-sync workflow must never overwrite in derived repos.
# Everything NOT listed here is treated as template-owned and kept in sync;
# conflicts with local edits surface in the sync PR for review. Files that
# exist only downstream (e.g. your src/ tree) are never touched by sync.
#
# Note: per actions-template-sync, this file itself is not synced — each
# derived repo owns its copy and may extend it with project-divergent paths.

# Replaced per project
README.md

# Customized on day 0 with real owners
.github/CODEOWNERS

# Gains project-specific variables downstream
.env.example

# May be relicensed per project
LICENSE

